    "detailed_description": "In Splinterra you will explore a world of floating islands, each with their unique theme, flora and fauna.<br>You will use cards to cast powerful spells and summon creatures to aid you in combat.<br>The combat uses aspects of auto battlers and rpg games. It has the fluid feeling of real time combat but the reliability of turn based games.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2779600/extras/2ba24dc377b8fc4bce10594bc625a6ac.avif?t=1747328506\" width=640 height=360 /></span><br><br>Upgrade your airship to reach new islands, but on your way you might get attacked by pirates. Will you flee or take on the pirates to acquire their treasure?<br>Cards will feel alive like in few games before it. Trade them or put eggs in empty cards to hatch them.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2779600/extras/cf63f4e4badc13df3f042123b354997e.avif?t=1747328506\" width=640 height=702 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2779600/extras/604ca8069bc59f11dffcf5d9bc7f2a2b.avif?t=1747328506\" width=640 height=408 /></span>",
